WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Do you know how to fish out drill bits at construction sites?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,720
I want good water

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,680
Who dares to go if the water is not good enough?

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:08,200
I'm afraid that if you have a life, you can make money, but you can't spend it. Don't worry, you can get everything back.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,600
Twenty thousand is a sum of money

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,880
I can buy 10,000 kilograms of rice

7
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,680
I'm very happy, big brother, big brother

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,800
He's talking nonsense

9
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,940
What a puppet person

10
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,980
At first glance, he looks like he is working on a construction site.

11
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,940
Are you sure you're in good health? Are you sure you're in charge of the food? Of course you're in charge of the food.

12
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,420
If you can fish out the drill bit for me

13
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,260
I'll get you as many servings as you want

14
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:32,750
Twenty thousand yuan is a lot, so I'll get in the car with you.

15
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,350
I'll go and communicate with the leader first.

16
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,630
Just wait for me

17
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:36,630
My Brother Xiao

18
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,350
Why did you agree to such a thing?

19
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,870
Do you know what a fishing drill is?

20
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,950
That's a long-lasting thing

21
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:43,630
Otherwise, it will cost you 20,000 yuan to get a drill bit.

22
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,150
How can there be such a good thing?

23
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,230
You are not afraid of death

24
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:48,390
Is it that dangerous? Yes

25
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,350
It's okay

26
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:50,670
I can handle it

27
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:52,260
You two follow me

28
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,140
Our drill bit fell inside.

29
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,180
Our people can't fish it out

30
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,740
Dangerous but safe

31
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,720
Only twenty thousand yuan

32
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,240
Brother Xiao is such a good person

33
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,760
If something happens, you can turn it around
